>>
endobj
571 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 250 0 R
/E (AI-enabled TEAM operations are not a revenue-cycle add-on, they are a clinical-AI strategy leveraged to reduce administrative burden on the administrative and clinical teams while optimizing surgical care delivery in a vulnerable patient population, older adults. Documentation, care pathway adherence, post-acute placement, referral coordination, and the integration of evidence-based practices that drive surgical outcomes and patient-reported measures are all critical points along the perioperative continuum where an AI-enabled platform such as Rainfall Health can connect care team members and augment performance in real time. The C-suite question is no longer whether to deploy an AI platform as part of TEAM reporting, but whether to deploy it before or after the first)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
572 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 250 0 R
/E (reconciliation cycle, once penalties are realized. Given the compounding-penalty math, the possibility for incentive payments, and the procedure-mix asymmetry shown above, the cost of waiting is materially higher than the cost of acting proactively.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [19]
>>
endobj
