<<
/Title (As a result, health systems must robustly operationalize coordinated, continuous, and evidence-based care across the entire perioperative continuum, from preoperative optimization through recovery at home. This level of orchestration is not achievable with traditional manual approaches. AI-enabled platforms such as Rainfall Health are becoming essential, offering real-time visibility into patient progress, care processes, and projected outcomes, replacing delayed, retrospective reporting with actionable insight.)
