1673 0 obj
<<
/Title (TEAM is not a pilot. As of January 1, 2026, 721 acute-care hospitals across 188 CBSAs will be reconciled annually on the cost and quality of every CABG, major bowel, lower extremity joint replacement, surgical hip and femur fracture, and spinal fusion episode across a 30-day post-discharge window. Industry modeling estimates 56% of mandatory participants will lose money in the first reconciliation cycle, with an average loss of $1.2M per facility.   For systems performing all five procedures at scale, total exposure across the five-year performance window can exceed $14M before HRRP, HAC Reduction, and VBP penalties are layered in.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1668 0 R
/Prev 1677 0 R
>>
endobj
